@model int

@*
    The file's version, swapped back into the form out of band.

    Every response that writes the file carries this, and that is not decoration:
    the version in the page is what the next write is checked against, so a
    response that changed the row and left the input alone would make the user's
    own next press conflict with their own last one. One partial, included by
    every write response, so the rule is in one place rather than remembered
    twice.
*@

<input type="hidden" name="Version" id="Version" value="@Model" hx-swap-oob="true" />
